  "title": "We helped Lobau Village plant trees in Fiji 🙌🏼 🌴 Places Like Lobau Vi...",
  "description": "We helped Lobau Village plant trees in Fiji 🙌🏼 🌴 Places Like Lobau Village are affected by climate change heavily so us helping them do this will help with their climate resilience mitigation efforts 🍃🫶🏼  Seeing their Village and Hearing their stories about how they’ve been affected was very sad, so It was awesome we could help in a way 🙌🏼 The Visiting definitely made me feel privilege and grateful for what we have at home. What a great wake up call to understanding more with what’s happening around us and overseas when facing Climate Change 🍃 Also, the planting of trees helps remove carbon dioxide from the atmosphere and is a powerful way to combat climate change and reduce our carbon footprint 🌴 It’ll also help prevent soil erosion in Lobau Village 🙌🏼 Not only that but planting these trees is also helping with one of Fiji’s NDC targets which is to plant 30 million trees by 2035 🙌🏼 Anymore Henry’s out there? 😂🌴 #SwipeUpForChange #ClimateChange #NDC #pacificndchub ",
